      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "NovaStrike:\r\nDoing AoE Splash damage and this Attack has 100% chance
    of hitting 5 enemies and use 100% normal damage +if crit +if bonus damage. and
    taunts all nearby enemy\u2019s or bosses! So, if Nova Strike hits main target
    for 4000 Nearby targets also gets 4000 physical damage. have 2.5 sec CD \r\nAvailable:
    level 5 requires & 5 points spent in Tank Talents\r\nMaximum Rank: 25\r\nSkill
    Type:\r\nMelee Skill Upgrade\r\nSkill Effect:\r\nA strong melee Nova Strike that
    consumes 20 Nova.\r\n"
